Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sync History tab mein aapko har sync ka record milta hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.57,0:00:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Timestamp, kitne vouchers aaye, kaunsi tables update hui, koi error toh nahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Green tick matlab successful, red exclamation matlab failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.17,0:00:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Failed sync pe click kariye — error detail milega.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Common issues — Tally band tha, network gaya, ya password galat tha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.57,0:00:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Retry button hai — dabaaein, agent turant fir se try karega.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Agar bar bar fail ho raha hai WhatsApp par FLOWRA support ko screenshot bhejo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,team turant help karegi.
